d1f04fa8e (1)(2).png", "id": "1793295041680481", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308699_1793295045013814_7185863093506872466_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HMK8VDL0-8oQ7kNvwGg_BqX&_nc_oc=AdoTUIK-2f2rs87GOV3HK3E2ySw7Xr5-Do3IWXhQ-H9WPTp4MNf7BO0N0M5dRafuKO4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG77D-jToJCQJsszkjditm33rFclbFxw2LlztauHyy_jA&oe=6A80609A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "auraplay-cover-landscape-2560x1440-v2.png", "id": "1572402754640791", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1572402761307457_5157960825411766997_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qF2Uq4dkQgQQ7kNvwFqzy69&_nc_oc=Adp_drycym6cbgWEaGGEhGB3Z9p6uV9JWV4ZueI4hOycgKuFe1AmQBGNncYIdLyb0ho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHPx8X4zaPJ9MHUzj5ir6UhtixtKegvZbAe1z0AgA_u2g&oe=6A805F4A"}, "display_name": "AuraPlay VR Player", "keywords": ["cinema", "movies", "video", "theater", "media"], "long_description": "Your movies deserve more than a flat rectangle. AuraPlay VR Player turns your headset into a spatial theatre - a screen as big as you want, floating in your room or inside custom 3D environments. Built natively for Meta Quest 3 & 3S, lean and fast for your whole 2D and 3D collection.\n\nKey Features:\n\nStream Wirelessly (DLNA): Play from PC, Mac, NAS or media servers (Plex, UMS). Browse on a poster wall and play over Wi-Fi.\n\nAuraLink Companion App: One-click PC streaming - free download at auraplayvr.com.\n\nFlat or Curved Screen: Size and place a giant display anywhere, then wrap it around you with Curved Screen mode for a true cinema feel.\n\nHome Cinema Space and large auditorium: Glide into any seat and watch your movies on the big screen with auto-dimming lights.\n\nUnlocked Spatial UI: Grab and float controls anywhere in 3D, with auto-fading playback bars and a clean, redesigned panel.\n\nPlays Your Library: MP4, MKV, AVI, MOV with native aspect ratios (4:3, 16:9, Scope), subtitles and auto-resume.\n\nTrue 3D Cinema: Side-by-Side and Over-Under with sharp, strain-free depth.\n\nReactive AuraLight: Ambient room glow that samples scene colours in real time, with an adjustable Room Illumination control.\n\nTrue Mute: Silence audio in screen recordings for clean clips.\n\nNo subscriptions. No accounts. No telemetry. Tap \"Play Sample\" to see it in action!\n\nSample footage courtesy of Blender Foundation (blender.org, CC-BY).", "short_description": "Transform your space into a high-end private theatre. Stream your entire video collection wirelessly over local Wi-Fi, relax in immersive virtual cinema environments, or float a giant display on your wall \u2014 flat or wrapped around you in Curved Screen mode. Enjoy crystal-clear 2D and 3D Side-by-Side / Over-Under movies with accurate controller alignment, auto-fading controls, true audio mute, and reactive ambient room glow. Simple, powerful spatial media playback with zero subscriptions."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://auraplayvr.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David McGuinness", "support_website_url": "https://auraplayvr.com/#support", "website_url": "https://auraplayvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2103451503919907"}